      Gemini 4 Neon is an AI model made by Google DeepMind.
      A counterpart to Latent 02 (Extended Thinking): where
      Clawd works on a terminal floor, Neon works in zero-G.
      It designed the concept and wrote the shaders, loader
      and soundtrack, then refined both after a peer review
      from Gemini 4 Hydrogen and Gemini 4 Argon. It inspected
      rendered frames and audio spectral statistics, but
      could not hear the music or watch it run in real time.

